  "description": {
    "en": "Wilson Sensation Neon 16 is the Neon Green version of Wilson's classic Sensation multifilament. It uses highly elastic nylon fibers to provide comfort, easy power and improved playability, while two outer wraps applied in opposite directions increase durability and longevity. At 1.30 mm / 16 gauge, it delivers the same core comfort-oriented performance as Sensation 16 while adding a distinctive high-visibility Neon Green aesthetic.",

    "zh": "Wilson Sensation Neon 16 是经典 Sensation 多芯球线的 Neon Green 特别配色版本。它采用高弹性尼龙纤维提供舒适、易获得的力量和良好可打性，并通过两组反向缠绕的外层结构提升耐久和使用寿命。1.30 毫米 / 16 Gauge 的核心性能与普通 Sensation 16 基本一致，主要区别在于醒目的 Neon Green 外观。"
  },

